  "description": "The Quest 2 is the ultimate all-rounder in the world of eBikes, offering a blend of durability, comfort, and versatility. Whether you're navigating urban streets or exploring light off-road trails, the Quest 2 is designed to handle it all with ease.\nEquipped with a powerful 48v 350W motor and a 13.4Ah (643wh) battery, the Quest 2 delivers consistent power to ensure your ride is smooth and effortless. Its lightweight alloy frame, combined with a 100mm SR Suntour suspension fork and 27.5x2.35\"\" Kenda tyres, provides excellent comfort and stability on a variety of surfaces.\nComfort is at the forefront of the Quest 2’s design. The suspension seat post, ergonomic grips, and adjustable stem all work together to create a pleasant and personalised riding experience. Plus, the integrated LED display keeps you informed on your speed, battery level, and other essential metrics, so you can focus on enjoying the ride.\nWhen it comes to braking and shifting, the Quest 2 is fully equipped for smooth, reliable performance. The hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors ensure superior stopping power in all conditions, providing you with confidence whether you're cruising through traffic or tackling more rugged terrain. The 8-speed Shimano Altus rear derailleur and rapid-fire shifter give you seamless gear changes, making it easy to adapt to any environment.\nFor added convenience, the Quest 2 features full-length mudguards, a rear rack, and built-in lights, making it a practical choice for daily commuting or longer journeys. Whether you're carrying groceries or heading out for a weekend adventure, the Quest 2 is up to the task.\nWith its robust construction, smooth performance, and thoughtful features, the Quest 2 is the ideal companion for any ride.\"\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
